# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` (in this same folder) and fill in your keys.
# `docker compose` reads `.env` automatically and injects it into the
# container at run time. The file is gitignored and is NOT baked into the
# image, so it is safe to keep local — never commit it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

